{"id":"wb-5-470","name":"天梯山石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天梯山石窟","text":"天梯山石窟，起始名为凉州石窟，位于甘肃省武威市凉州城南约50公里的天梯山上，分布在西南峭崖绝壁间。石窟开凿于北凉沮渠蒙逊时（公元412~439年）北魏、北周、隋、唐、西夏、元诸代都曾在这里开窟或重建，至明、清时期已成为喇嘛寺院。现存洞窟3层19处，窟内保存壁画数百平方米，佛像100多尊。1959年9月，因修建黄羊河水库，窟址处于水库淹没区，部分造像、壁画搬迁至甘肃省博物馆。2001年，入选第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E6%A2%AF%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":94875902,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94875902","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/53abfbc906c943516d6438d3.jpg","title":"Tiantishan_Grotto_Budda.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tiantishan_Grotto_Budda.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4e/Tiantishan_Grotto_Budda.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Hiroooooo","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​天梯山石窟,甘肃武威","width":320,"height":240}}